.TH shiftpaper-fetch-model 1  shiftpaper 
.SH NAME
shiftpaper\-fetch\-model \- Download a depth model to bake with
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshiftpaper fetch\-model\fR [\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download a depth model to bake with.
.PP
Downloads from HuggingFace and makes it the model `set`, `slideshow` and `bake` use. Without a name, downloads the default model. Files go to ~/.local/share/shiftpaper/models/<name>/ and the path is written to [inference] model_path in config.toml. Safe to re\-run: the download is skipped if the files already exist, unless \-\-force is given. Each model\*(Aqs weights have their own licence, shown before downloading.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
List the models that can be downloaded
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-force\fR
Re\-download even if the files already exist
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Which model to download. See \-\-list
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
shiftpaper fetch\-model               Download the default model
shiftpaper fetch\-model \-\-list        List the models and their sizes
shiftpaper fetch\-model moge\-2\-vits   Download a smaller, faster model
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
shiftpaper(1)
.PP
The docs: https://github.com/CPritch/shiftpaper/tree/main/docs
